#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3330
msgid "The data entry box widget"
msgstr "Inmatningsfältet för data"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3338
msgid ""
"This screenshot depicts the widget used to enter data as defined values, "
"references or expressions."
msgstr ""
"Skärmbilden visar fältet där du anger data som värden, referenser eller "
"uttryck."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3344
msgid ""
"The data entry box widget allows users to enter data as defined values (e.g."
" \"A name\", 123, or {12,32,14}), as references (e.g. 'Sheet1!A2:B4'), or as"
" expressions (e.g. sin({11,16}) )."
msgstr ""
"I inmatningsfältet kan du ange data som värden (till exempel ”Ett namn”, 123"
" eller {12,32,14}), referenser (till exempel ”Sheet1!A2:B4”) eller uttryck "
"(till exempel sin({11,16}) )."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3324
msgid ""
"A number of properties of the graph are configured using the "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> entry box shown in <xref linkend=\"fig-"
"widget-entryBox\"/>. <_:figure-1/> Information can be inserted to the data "
"entry box, first, by selecting the box with a mouse click and, then, either "
"typing data on a keyboard or using the mouse to select a region of the "
"worksheet."
msgstr ""
"Du ställer in flera diagramegenskaper i inmatningsfältet i "
"<application>Gnumeric</application>, som visas i <xref linkend=\"fig-widget-"
"entryBox\"/>. <_:figure-1/> Mata in information genom att klicka i fältet "
"och sedan skriva på tangentbordet eller markera ett område i kalkylbladet "
"med musen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3366
msgid "Background Panels: Graphs &amp; Charts"
msgstr "Bakgrundspaneler: grafer och diagram"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3368
msgid ""
"Several elements of the graph function as background panels for the other "
"elements. These panels can be configured to display a visible background "
"consisting of a solid color, a pattern, a gradient, or an image. "
"Alternatively, the panel can be made transparent to show the underlying "
"panel, if any. Where there are only transparent panels, the worksheet itself"
" will be visible behind the graph."
msgstr ""
"Flera diagramelement fungerar som bakgrundspaneler för andra element. Du kan"
" ge panelerna en synlig bakgrund med en färg, ett mönster, en toning eller "
"en bild. Du kan också göra panelen genomskinlig så att panelen bakom, om det"
" finns någon, syns. Om alla paneler är genomskinliga syns kalkylbladet bakom"
" diagrammet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3379
msgid "The background panel configuration."
msgstr "Inställningar för bakgrundspanelen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3387 C/gnumeric.xml:3394
msgid ""
"This screenshot depicts the two elements of background panels which can be "
"configured, the background fill and the outline."
msgstr ""
"Skärmbilden visar de två inställningar som kan ändras för bakgrundspaneler: "
"fyllning och kontur."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3404
msgid ""
"The background panel <guilabel>Fill</guilabel> refers to the area which is "
"behind the entire component. The <guilabel>Outline</guilabel> refers to a "
"solid box which will be drawn around the edge of the component."
msgstr ""
"Bakgrundspanelens <guilabel>Fyllning</guilabel> gäller området bakom hela "
"komponenten. <guilabel>Kontur</guilabel> är en heldragen linje runt "
"komponentens kant."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3411
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Outline</guilabel> can be configured by selecting a color "
"using the color picker widget and by choosing a size using the spin button "
"box. A size of '-1' indicates that no line will be drawn, whereas sizes zero"
" and above indicate the size of the line that will be drawn."
msgstr ""
"Välj färg för <guilabel>Kontur</guilabel> med färgväljaren och ange "
"linjebredd med fältets pilknappar. Värdet ’-1’ innebär att ingen linje "
"ritas; noll eller högre anger linjens bredd."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3419
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Fill</guilabel> can be configured to be a pattern, which "
"includes a solid color, a gradient or an image."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ställa in <guilabel>Fyllning</guilabel> som ett mönster, en enfärgad "
"fyllning, en toning eller en bild."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3425
msgid "The pattern background panel fill configuration."
msgstr "Mönsterinställningar för bakgrundspanelens fyllning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3433 C/gnumeric.xml:3439
msgid ""
"This screenshot depicts the configuration properties for the pattern "
"background panel fill."
msgstr ""
"Skärmbilden visar inställningarna för mönsterfyllning av bakgrundspanelen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3448
msgid ""
"The fill using a pattern enables the panel background to consist either of a"
" solid color, or of a solid color overlain by a pattern. The top drop down "
"button, labeled <guilabel>Pattern</guilabel>, allows the user to select the "
"pattern overlay from a number of different standard patterns. The pattern in"
" the top left corner is an empty pattern which allows the background color "
"indicated in the third drop down button to fill the panel. The middle drop "
"down button, labeled <guilabel>Foreground</guilabel>, allows the user to "
"select the color of the overlay in the pattern. The bottom drop down button,"
" labeled <guilabel>Background</guilabel>, allows the user to select the "
"color of the underlay. If the pattern is empty, the color of the Background "
"will be the color of the entire panel."
msgstr ""
"Med mönsterfyllning kan panelbakgrunden bestå av en enda färg eller av en "
"färg med ett mönster ovanpå. Välj mönster i den översta rullgardinsknappen "
"<guilabel>Mönster</guilabel>. Mönstret längst upp till vänster är tomt; då "
"fylls panelen med bakgrundsfärgen som anges i den tredje rullgardinsknappen."
" I den mittersta knappen <guilabel>Förgrund</guilabel> väljer du mönstrets "
"färg. I den nedersta knappen <guilabel>Bakgrund</guilabel> väljer du färgen "
"under mönstret. Om mönstret är tomt fylls hela panelen med bakgrundsfärgen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3466
msgid ""
"If all of these buttons appear black, change the color of the "
"<guilabel>Background</guilabel> to white to see the pattern and foreground "
"color."
msgstr ""
"Om alla knapparna ser svarta ut ändrar du <guilabel>Bakgrund</guilabel> till"
" vit för att se mönstret och förgrundsfärgen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3474
msgid "The gradient background panel fill configuration."
msgstr "Inställningar för toning i bakgrundspanelen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3482 C/gnumeric.xml:3488
msgid ""
"This screenshot depicts the configuration properties for the gradient "
"background panel fill."
msgstr "Skärmbilden visar inställningarna för toning i bakgrundspanelen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3497
msgid ""
"The background panel can be filled with a gradient transitioning either "
"between two colors or between a color and a tone, either white or black. The"
" top drop down button, labeled <guilabel>Direction</guilabel>, gives the "
"user a number of choices for the direction in which the gradient will "
"operate. The drop down button named <guilabel>Type</guilabel> allows the "
"user to pick between gradients which transition between two colors, the "
"<guilabel>2 Colors</guilabel> option, and gradients that transition from a "
"color to pure white or pure black, the <guilabel>Brightness</guilabel> "
"option. The drop down buttons for the <guilabel>Start</guilabel> and "
"<guilabel>End</guilabel> colors allow the user to pick the colors in the "
"gradient. For the brightness gradients, a slider allows the user to select "
"the transition direction. Moving the slider toward "
"<guilabel>Brighter</guilabel> will fade the color to white whereas moving "
"the slider toward <guilabel>Darker</guilabel> will fade the color toward "
"black."
msgstr ""
"Du kan fylla bakgrundspanelen med en toning mellan två färger eller mellan "
"en färg och vitt eller svart. I den översta rullgardinsknappen "
"<guilabel>Riktning</guilabel> väljer du toningens riktning. I knappen "
"<guilabel>Typ</guilabel> väljer du mellan toning mellan två färger med "
"alternativet <guilabel>2 färger</guilabel> och toning från en färg till rent"
" vitt eller svart med alternativet <guilabel>Ljusstyrka</guilabel>. Med "
"rullgardinsknapparna <guilabel>Start</guilabel> och "
"<guilabel>Slut</guilabel> väljer du toningens färger. För toningar med "
"ljusstyrka anger du riktningen med skjutreglaget: mot "
"<guilabel>Ljusare</guilabel> tonas färgen ut till vitt och mot "
"<guilabel>Mörkare</guilabel> till svart."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:3518
msgid ""
"If all of these buttons appear black, change the color of the "
"<guilabel>Start</guilabel> button to white to see the gradient."
msgstr ""
"Om alla knapparna ser svarta ut ändrar du <guilabel>Start</guilabel> till "
"vit för att se toningen."
